title: Handle the XCMP messages in a round-robin fashion
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Handle the XCMP messages in a round-robin fashion: enqueue 1 batch per sender until we finish enqueuing or we are out of weight

    This respects the XCMP ordering per sender which should be enough since the `messages-queue` pallet also stores the messages per sender and processes them in a round-robin fashion.
crates:
- name: cumulus-pallet-xcmp-queue
  bump: patch
